{"id":"annahme","lemma":"Annahme","pos":"noun","rank":3923,"glosses":["presupposition, assumption, hypothesis","acceptance, the act of accepting","receipt, reception, the act of receiving"],"ipa":"/ˈanˌnaːmə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/03/De-at-Annahme.ogg/De-at-Annahme.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Annahme","plural":"Annahmen"},"examples":[{"text":"Deine Annahme ist, denke ich, richtig.","en":"I think your hypothesis is correct.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"correct"}]},{"text":"Das sind nur Annahmen.","en":"Those are just assumptions.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"only"},null]},{"text":"Das war nur eine Annahme.","en":"It was just an assumption.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Unsere anfänglichen Annahmen waren falsch.","en":"Our initial assumptions were wrong.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"at first, initially","l":"anfänglich"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"false"}]},{"text":"Deine Annahme ist richtig.","en":"Your hypothesis is correct.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"correct"}]}]}